00:17:56.560 --> 00:18:25.640
Carly Huitema (University of Guelph): And the point is is that everything depends on this lookup table. If you find any item and you want to know what's its identifier, you have to verify it in the authoritative lookup table in order to find what the identifier is, it might give itself a fake id identifier. Certainly chat Gpt likes to stick them in all over the place, but the only authoritative source is where is being held by the governance body that controls that identifier.

